This directory is a trimmed copy of the upstream repository, used as the
compression engine of the Bash output wrapper of this configuration
(hooks/lib/compress/). It is never installed, never registers a hook, and
grants no permission.

Removed paths (not needed at runtime, or would act as instructions, hooks,
installers or permissions for Claude Code):

  CLAUDE.md
  AGENTS.md, src/AGENTS.md, src/processors/AGENTS.md, tests/AGENTS.md
  .claude-plugin/
  .github/
  hooks/
  commands/
  skills/
  antigravity/
  installers/
  install.py
  docs/
  examples/
  bin/
  scripts/
  llms.txt
  CONTRIBUTING.md
  mypy.ini
  .pylintrc
  .gitignore

Kept: src/, tests/, LICENSE, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, pyproject.toml,
.upstream-commit.

Modifications: none to src/; invoked through an adapter
(hooks/lib/compress/ts_adapter.py) that imports only the compression engine,
forces the built-in default configuration and loads no module that writes to
disk or uses the network.

Some upstream tests import removed paths (scripts/, bin/, installers/,
docs/, examples/, antigravity/, .claude-plugin/) and fail or cannot be
collected in this trimmed copy; they are kept unmodified and are not run by
this repository's CI.

The fixtures under tests/compress/upstream/ at the root of this repository
are outputs generated by upstream's scripts/audit_compression.py scenarios
(same license).
